{"code":"hi","name":"Hindi","native":"हिन्दी","phase":2,"medium":"en","file_level":"B1","level":{"title":"Intermediate: ने, commands, family, opinions","goals":["Master ने-ergative and have-to forms","Command politely and talk family","Argue opinions and describe weather"],"units":[{"id":"B1-U1","title":"Ergative and compulsion","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U1-L1","title":"ने: मैंने खाया","learn":"Past twist! मैंने खाया (I ate — boy object?) NO — the verb agrees with the OBJECT! मैंने रोटी खाई (I ate bread-f)! मैंने काम किया (I did work-m)! Subject takes ने, verb follows the object!","vocab":[{"t":"मैंने","r":"mainne","en":"I (past agent)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"तुमने","r":"tumne","en":"you (past agent)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"उसने","r":"usne","en":"he/she (past agent)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"हमने","r":"hamne","en":"we (past agent)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"आपने","r":"āpne","en":"you formal (past agent)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"उन्होंने","r":"unhonne","en":"they (past agent)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"खाया","r":"khāyā","en":"ate (m object)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"देखा","r":"dekhā","en":"saw (m object)","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"ने + verb agrees with OBJECT","explain":"मैंने रोटी खाई (bread-f → खाई!), मैंने सेब खाया (apple-m → खाया!). Boy or girl speaker — doesn't matter! Only the OBJECT decides!","pattern":"Xने + object + verb-agrees-object","examples":[{"t":"मैंने रोटी खाई।","r":"mainne roṭī khāī.","en":"I ate bread."},{"t":"उसने फिल्म देखी।","r":"usne film dekhī.","en":"He/she watched a film. (f)"},{"t":"हमने काम किया।","r":"hamne kām kiyā.","en":"We did work. (m)"}],"mistakes":["Boys saying मैंने रोटी खाया — रोटी (f) needs खाई!","Forgetting ने: past-transitive NEEDS मैंने/उसने!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"राहुल","t":"तुमने क्या खाया?","r":"tumne kyā khāyā?","en":"What did you eat? (casual)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मैंने रोटी खाई। तुमने?","r":"mainne roṭī khāī. tumne?","en":"I ate bread. And you?"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मैंने चावल खाए!","r":"mainne chāval khāe!","en":"I ate rice! (m-pl)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"अच्छा!","r":"achchhā!","en":"Nice!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I ate bread","answer":"मैंने रोटी खाई"},{"type":"fill","q":"उसने फिल्म ___। (watched, f)","answer":"देखी"},{"type":"choose","q":"'We did work' is…","options":["हम काम करते हैं","हमने काम किया","हम काम करेंगे","हमने काम की"],"answer":"हमने काम किया"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: खाई / रोटी / मैंने","answer":"मैंने रोटी खाई"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मैंने रोटी खाई।","answer":"मैंने रोटी खाई।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"मैंने रोटी खाई uses खाई because…","options":["speaker is girl","रोटी is feminine","plural","formal"],"answer":1,"why":"Verb agrees with OBJECT!."},{"q":"उसने means…","options":["he/she (now)","he/she (past agent)","they","you"],"answer":1,"why":"उस + ने = past agent."},{"q":"चावल खाए uses खाए because…","options":["speaker boy","चावल is m-plural","formal","future"],"answer":1,"why":"चावल (m-pl) → खाए."},{"q":"ने marks…","options":["objects","past agents","places","time"],"answer":1,"why":"मैंने/तुमने/उसने."},{"q":"मैंने काम किया uses किया because…","options":["speaker boy","काम is masculine","plural","formal"],"answer":1,"why":"काम (m) → किया."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"ने worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["I (past agent)","he/she (past agent)","they (past agent)"],"key":["मैंने","उसने","उन्होंने"]},{"instruction":"Agree with OBJECT.","items":["I ate bread","He/she watched a film","We did work"],"key":["मैंने रोटी खाई","उसने फिल्म देखी","हमने काम किया"]},{"instruction":"Ask yesterday.","items":["What did you eat? (casual)","Nice!"],"key":["तुमने क्या खाया","अच्छा"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U1-L2","title":"मुझे जाना है (have to)","learn":"Compulsion! मुझे जाना है = I HAVE to go. मुझे काम करना है (I have to work). Past: मुझे जाना था (I had to go). Wants: मुझे चाहिए (I want) — have-to vs want!","vocab":[{"t":"जाना","r":"jānā","en":"to go","pos":"verb"},{"t":"आना","r":"ānā","en":"to come","pos":"verb"},{"t":"करना","r":"karnā","en":"to do","pos":"verb"},{"t":"देना","r":"denā","en":"to give","pos":"verb"},{"t":"लेना","r":"lenā","en":"to take","pos":"verb"},{"t":"मुश्किल","r":"mushkil","en":"difficult","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"आसान","r":"āsān","en":"easy","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"ज़रूरी","r":"zarūrī","en":"necessary","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"मुझे X-ना है/था","explain":"मुझे जाना है (I have to go), मुझे जाना था (I had to go), मुझे जाना होगा (I'll have to go). Verb stays -ना, only है moves!","pattern":"मुझे + verb-ना + है/था/होगा","examples":[{"t":"मुझे स्कूल जाना है।","r":"mujhe skūl jānā hai.","en":"I have to go to school."},{"t":"मुझे काम करना था।","r":"mujhe kām karnā thā.","en":"I had to work."},{"t":"तुम्हें क्या करना है?","r":"tumhen kyā karnā hai?","en":"What do you have to do?"}],"mistakes":["Saying मैं जाना है — have-to needs मुझे!","Changing -ना: जाना stays जाना, only है moves!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"तुम्हें क्या करना है?","r":"tumhen kyā karnā hai?","en":"What do you have to do? (casual)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मुझे स्कूल जाना है। तुम्हें?","r":"mujhe skūl jānā hai. tumhen?","en":"I have to go to school. And you?"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मुझे काम करना है। मुश्किल है!","r":"mujhe kām karnā hai. mushkil hai!","en":"I have to work. It's difficult!"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"कोई बात नहीं!","r":"koī bāt nahīṅ!","en":"No problem!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have to go to school","answer":"मुझे स्कूल जाना है"},{"type":"fill","q":"मुझे काम करना ___। (had to)","answer":"था"},{"type":"choose","q":"'What do you have to do?' is…","options":["तुम क्या करते हो","तुम्हें क्या करना है","तुम क्या करोगे","तुमने क्या किया"],"answer":"तुम्हें क्या करना है"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: है / जाना / स्कूल / मुझे","answer":"मुझे स्कूल जाना है"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मुझे स्कूल जाना है।","answer":"मुझे स्कूल जाना है।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"मुझे जाना है means…","options":["I go","I have to go","I went","I want to go"],"answer":1,"why":"मुझे + ना + है = must."},{"q":"मुझे जाना था means…","options":["I go","I had to go","I will go","I want to go"],"answer":1,"why":"था = past compulsion."},{"q":"-ना in जाना है…","options":["changes tense","never changes","drops","doubles"],"answer":1,"why":"जाना frozen; है moves."},{"q":"मुश्किल means…","options":["easy","difficult","fast","slow"],"answer":1,"why":"मुश्किल = difficult."},{"q":"ज़रूरी means…","options":["free","necessary","ready","late"],"answer":1,"why":"ज़रूरी = necessary."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Have-to worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["to go","difficult","necessary"],"key":["जाना","मुश्किल","ज़रूरी"]},{"instruction":"Compulsions.","items":["I have to go to school","I had to work","What do you have to do?"],"key":["मुझे स्कूल जाना है","मुझे काम करना था","तुम्हें क्या करना है"]},{"instruction":"Sympathise.","items":["It's difficult!","No problem!"],"key":["मुश्किल है","कोई बात नहीं"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U2","title":"Commands and family","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U2-L1","title":"खाओ/खाइए + मत","learn":"Orders, three levels! खा (intimate — kids/lovers), खाओ (casual — friends), खाइए (formal — elders)! Soften: कृपया बैठिए = Please sit. Don't: मत — मत जाओ! (Don't go!)!","vocab":[{"t":"बैठो","r":"baiṭho","en":"sit! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"उठो","r":"uṭho","en":"get up! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"आओ","r":"āo","en":"come! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"जाओ","r":"jāo","en":"go! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"खोलो","r":"kholo","en":"open! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"बंद करो","r":"band karo","en":"close! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"सुनो","r":"suno","en":"listen! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"देखो","r":"dekho","en":"look! (casual)","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"-ओ/-इए · मत (don't)","explain":"बैठो (sit, casual), बैठिए (sit, formal)! बताओ/बताइए (tell). मत + verb: मत जाओ! (don't go!), मत बोलो! (don't speak!)!","pattern":"-ओ (friends) · -इए (elders) · मत + verb","examples":[{"t":"कृपया बैठिए!","r":"kripayā baiṭhie!","en":"Please sit! (formal)"},{"t":"यहाँ आओ!","r":"yahāṅ āo!","en":"Come here! (casual)"},{"t":"मत जाओ!","r":"mat jāo!","en":"Don't go!"}],"mistakes":["Saying बैठो to elders — elders get बैठिए!","Saying नहीं जाओ for don't — commands use मत!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"राहुल","t":"यहाँ आओ!","r":"yahāṅ āo!","en":"Come here! (casual)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मैं व्यस्त हूँ! वहाँ जाओ!","r":"main vyast hūṅ! vahāṅ jāo!","en":"I'm busy! Go there!"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"अच्छा! कृपया बैठिए!","r":"achchhā! kripayā baiṭhie!","en":"OK! Please sit! (formal)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"धन्यवाद!","r":"dhanyavād!","en":"Thanks!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (formal): Please sit!","answer":"कृपया बैठिए"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ जाओ! (Don't)","answer":"मत"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Come here! (casual)' is…","options":["यहाँ आइए","यहाँ आओ","यहाँ आ","यहाँ आना"],"answer":"यहाँ आओ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: बैठिए / कृपया","answer":"कृपया बैठिए"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: यहाँ आओ!","answer":"यहाँ आओ!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"-इए is for…","options":["friends","elders / formal","kids","self"],"answer":1,"why":"बैठिए — formal sit."},{"q":"-ओ is for…","options":["elders","friends / casual","bosses","strangers"],"answer":1,"why":"बैठो — casual."},{"q":"मत जाओ means…","options":["go quickly","don't go","go later","come here"],"answer":1,"why":"मत + verb = don't!"},{"q":"खोलो means…","options":["close!","open!","sit!","go!"],"answer":1,"why":"खोलो = open! (casual)"},{"q":"कृपया makes orders…","options":["stronger","polite","plural","past"],"answer":1,"why":"कृपया = please."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Commands worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["sit! (casual)","come! (casual)","listen! (casual)"],"key":["बैठो","आओ","सुनो"]},{"instruction":"Command people.","items":["Please sit! (formal)","Come here! (casual)","Don't go!"],"key":["कृपया बैठिए","यहाँ आओ","मत जाओ"]},{"instruction":"Boss around.","items":["Go there! (casual)","Thanks!"],"key":["वहाँ जाओ","धन्यवाद"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U2-L2","title":"Family: परिवार","learn":"Family + owners! पिता/पापा (father), माता/मम्मी (mother), भाई (brother), बहन (sister), बेटा/बेटी (son/daughter). मेरा/मेरी/मेरे agrees with the OWNED: मेरा भाई, मेरी बहन!","vocab":[{"t":"परिवार","r":"parivār","en":"family (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"पिता","r":"pitā","en":"father","pos":"noun"},{"t":"माता","r":"mātā","en":"mother","pos":"noun"},{"t":"भाई","r":"bhāī","en":"brother","pos":"noun"},{"t":"बहन","r":"bahan","en":"sister","pos":"noun"},{"t":"बेटा","r":"beṭā","en":"son","pos":"noun"},{"t":"बेटी","r":"beṭī","en":"daughter","pos":"noun"},{"t":"माता-पिता","r":"mātā-pitā","en":"parents","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"मेरा/मेरी/मेरे","explain":"मेरा भाई (my brother-m), मेरी बहन (my sister-f), मेरे दोस्त (my friends-m-pl)! Possessive follows the OWNED thing!","pattern":"मेरा (m) · मेरी (f) · मेरे (m-pl)","examples":[{"t":"मेरे पिता शिक्षक हैं।","r":"mere pitā shikshak hain.","en":"My father is a teacher."},{"t":"तुम्हारी माता?","r":"tumhārī mātā?","en":"And your mother? (casual)"},{"t":"मेरा परिवार बड़ा है।","r":"merā parivār baṛā hai.","en":"My family is big."}],"mistakes":["Saying मेरा बहन — बहन (f): मेरी!","Saying मेरा दोस्तों for plural — m-pl: मेरे!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"तुम्हारे परिवार में कितने लोग हैं?","r":"tumhāre parivār men kitne log hain?","en":"How many in your family? (casual)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"चार लोग। माता-पिता और मैं।","r":"chār log. mātā-pitā aur main.","en":"Four people. Parents and me (and one more)!"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"तुम्हारा भाई है?","r":"tumhārā bhāī hai?","en":"Do you have a brother?"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"हाँ, मेरा एक भाई है!","r":"hāṅ, merā ek bhāī hai!","en":"Yes, I have a brother!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: My father is a teacher","answer":"मेरे पिता शिक्षक हैं"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ बहन (My, f)","answer":"मेरी"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How many in your family?' is…","options":["तुम्हारा परिवार क्या है","तुम्हारे परिवार में कितने लोग हैं","तुम्हारा परिवार कहाँ है","तुम्हारे परिवार कौन है"],"answer":"तुम्हारे परिवार में कितने लोग हैं"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: शिक्षक हैं / पिता / मेरे","answer":"मेरे पिता शिक्षक हैं"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मेरे पिता शिक्षक हैं।","answer":"मेरे पिता शिक्षक हैं।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"मेरी बहन uses मेरी because…","options":["plural","बहन is feminine","formal","past"],"answer":1,"why":"मेरी + feminine."},{"q":"मेरे दोस्त uses मेरे because…","options":["one friend","masculine plural","feminine","formal"],"answer":1,"why":"मेरे + m-pl."},{"q":"माता-पिता means…","options":["brothers","parents","children","family"],"answer":1,"why":"माता-पिता = parents."},{"q":"बेटी means…","options":["son","daughter","sister","mother"],"answer":1,"why":"बेटी = daughter."},{"q":"Possessives agree with…","options":["the owner","the owned thing","nothing","the verb"],"answer":1,"why":"मेरा भाई / मेरी बहन."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Family worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["family","father","daughter"],"key":["परिवार","पिता","बेटी"]},{"instruction":"Own things.","items":["My father is a teacher","My sister","My friends (m)"],"key":["मेरे पिता शिक्षक हैं","मेरी बहन","मेरे दोस्त"]},{"instruction":"Count family.","items":["How many in your family? (casual)","Four people"],"key":["तुम्हारे परिवार में कितने लोग हैं","चार लोग"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U3","title":"Opinions and weather","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U3-L1","title":"मुझे लगता है + से","learn":"Opine! मुझे लगता है कि… (I feel that…): मुझे लगता है मेट्रो अच्छी है! Compare with से: दिल्ली मुंबई से बड़ी है (Delhi is bigger than Mumbai). सबसे = most: सबसे अच्छा = best!","vocab":[{"t":"लगना","r":"lagnā","en":"to feel / seem","pos":"verb"},{"t":"सोचना","r":"sochnā","en":"to think","pos":"verb"},{"t":"अच्छा","r":"achchhā","en":"good","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"बुरा","r":"burā","en":"bad","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"बेहतर","r":"behtar","en":"better","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"सबसे","r":"sabse","en":"most / -est","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"राय","r":"rāy","en":"opinion (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"सहमत","r":"sahmat","en":"agreed","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"मुझे लगता है + X से + adj","explain":"मुझे लगता है मेट्रो अच्छी है (I think the metro is good). दिल्ली मुंबई से बड़ी है (Delhi is bigger than Mumbai). सबसे सस्ता = cheapest!","pattern":"लगता है… · A B से + adj · सबसे","examples":[{"t":"मुझे लगता है यह अच्छा है।","r":"mujhe lagtā hai yah achchhā hai.","en":"I think this is good."},{"t":"दिल्ली मुंबई से बड़ी है।","r":"Dillī Mumbaī se baṛī hai.","en":"Delhi is bigger than Mumbai."},{"t":"यह सबसे अच्छा है!","r":"yah sabse achchhā hai!","en":"This is the best!"}],"mistakes":["Saying से दिल्ली बड़ी — order: A B से: दिल्ली मुंबई से!","Saying सबसे बहुत अच्छा — सबसे replaces बहुत!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मुझे लगता है मेट्रो अच्छी है।","r":"mujhe lagtā hai meṭro achchhī hai.","en":"I think the metro is good."},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मुझे लगता है गाड़ी तेज़ है।","r":"mujhe lagtā hai gāṛī tez hai.","en":"I think the car is fast."},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"लेकिन मेट्रो सस्ती है!","r":"lekin meṭro sastī hai!","en":"But the metro is cheap!"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"सहमत!","r":"sahmat!","en":"Agreed!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think this is good","answer":"मुझे लगता है यह अच्छा है"},{"type":"fill","q":"यह ___ अच्छा है! (most)","answer":"सबसे"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Delhi is bigger than Mumbai' is…","options":["दिल्ली मुंबई बड़ी है","दिल्ली मुंबई से बड़ी है","दिल्ली सबसे मुंबई बड़ी","से दिल्ली मुंबई बड़ी"],"answer":"दिल्ली मुंबई से बड़ी है"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: है / अच्छा / यह / लगता / मुझे","answer":"मुझे लगता है यह अच्छा है"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मुझे लगता है मेट्रो अच्छी है।","answer":"मुझे लगता है मेट्रो अच्छी है।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"मुझे लगता है means…","options":["I know","I think/feel","I see","I want"],"answer":1,"why":"लगता है = it-feels-to-me."},{"q":"A B से orders…","options":["B-से-A","A B-से","से-A-B","A-B-से-है"],"answer":1,"why":"दिल्ली मुंबई से बड़ी."},{"q":"सबसे means…","options":["more","most","very","less"],"answer":1,"why":"सबसे = -est."},{"q":"बुरा means…","options":["good","bad","big","small"],"answer":1,"why":"बुरा = bad."},{"q":"सहमत means…","options":["disagree","agreed","maybe","never"],"answer":1,"why":"सहमत = agreed."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Opinions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["to feel/seem","better","opinion"],"key":["लगना","बेहतर","राय"]},{"instruction":"Think and compare.","items":["I think this is good","Delhi is bigger than Mumbai","This is the best"],"key":["मुझे लगता है यह अच्छा है","दिल्ली मुंबई से बड़ी है","यह सबसे अच्छा है"]},{"instruction":"Debate.","items":["But the metro is cheap!","Agreed!"],"key":["लेकिन मेट्रो सस्ती है","सहमत"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U3-L2","title":"Weather: मौसम","learn":"Weather talk! मौसम कैसा है? (How's the weather?) → ठंड है (It's cold). बारिश हो रही है (It's raining), बर्फ़ पड़ रही है (It's snowing). Feelings: मुझे ठंड लग रही है (I feel cold)!","vocab":[{"t":"मौसम","r":"mausam","en":"weather (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"सूरज","r":"sūraj","en":"sun (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"बारिश","r":"bārish","en":"rain (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"बर्फ़","r":"barf","en":"snow/ice (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ठंडा","r":"ṭhanḍā","en":"cold","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"गर्म","r":"garm","en":"hot","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"सुहाना","r":"suhānā","en":"pleasant","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"हवा","r":"havā","en":"wind (f)","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"बारिश हो रही है · ठंड है","explain":"बारिश हो रही है (rain is happening = it's raining). ठंड है (cold exists = it's cold). Feel it: मुझे ठंड लग रही है (to-me cold feels)!","pattern":"बारिश/बर्फ़ हो रही है · ठंड/गर्मी है","examples":[{"t":"आज ठंड है।","r":"āj ṭhanḍ hai.","en":"Today is cold."},{"t":"बारिश हो रही है।","r":"bārish ho rahī hai.","en":"It's raining."},{"t":"कल गर्मी थी।","r":"kal garmī thī.","en":"Yesterday was hot."}],"mistakes":["Sa